{
  "uid": "scheduler-overview",
  "title": "Unified Service Scheduler - Operations",
  "tags": ["service-scheduler"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "description": "Local demo telemetry. Counter panels may show 0 or no data before traffic; latency panels show No data rather than a synthetic value; ratio panels use guarded denominators and show 0% when there is no traffic.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by route/method",
      "description": "No data until traffic arrives. Health probes are excluded from request telemetry.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "0",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (route, method) (rate(scheduler_http_requests_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}} {{method}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP p95 latency",
      "description": "No data until traffic arrives. No synthetic latency point is produced for zero traffic.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route, http_request_method) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}} {{http_request_method}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx error ratio",
      "description": "0% when there is no request traffic; the guarded denominator avoids NaN.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "noValue": "0%",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(scheduler_http_requests_total{status_class=\"5xx\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(scheduler_http_requests_total[$__rate_interval])), 1e-9) or vector(0)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cache hit ratio",
      "description": "Transport-level hit ratio: a corrupt cached payload counts as a get hit before fallback. 0% means no get traffic or no hits; inspect the cache operations and failure panels to distinguish.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "noValue": "0%",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(scheduler_cache_operations_total{operation=\"get\", result=\"hit\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(scheduler_cache_operations_total{operation=\"get\", result=~\"hit|miss\"}[$__rate_interval])), 1e-9) or vector(0)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cache get failures",
      "description": "Redis degradation signal. Zero or no data while the cache is healthy.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "noValue": "0",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(scheduler_cache_operations_total{operation=\"get\", result=\"failure\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "get failures",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Booking final outcomes",
      "description": "Final controller outcomes. No data before booking traffic; no outcome series yet is shown as 0.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "0",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 25, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(scheduler_booking_outcomes_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Booking procedure attempts",
      "description": "Internal procedure attempts distinguish retries from the final HTTP booking outcome.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "0",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (result) (rate(scheduler_booking_procedure_attempts_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Booking allocation p95",
      "description": "No data until allocation traffic arrives; no synthetic latency point is produced.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, outcome) (rate(scheduler_booking_allocation_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cache operations",
      "description": "Hits, misses, and set/remove success or failure by operation. No data until catalog traffic arrives.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "noValue": "0",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (operation, result) (rate(scheduler_cache_operations_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} {{result}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Correlation instructions",
      "description": "How to move from a request to its trace.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Correlation\n\nCopy the `TraceId` from the API JSON logs or the Problem Details `traceId`, then open **Explore -> Tempo** and query the trace ID. The same 32-hex value identifies the Tempo trace; logs also carry a `SpanId`. Metrics are aggregate signals with bounded labels only and do not contain trace IDs.\n\nZero traffic: counter/rate panels may show `0` or **No data**; latency panels show **No data**; ratio panels show `0%` when their guarded denominator is empty."
      }
    }
  ]
}
